---
- name: "MAKE_AUTOCONF is deprecated; migrate to the MAKE subsystem"
  fail:
    msg: >-
      MAKE_AUTOCONF has been replaced by the gen_make subsystem. Set
      MAKE: True (and optionally MAKE_TARGET) instead of MAKE_AUTOCONF: True.
      See gen_make.tasks and _make_bins in vars/common.yaml.
